            <section class="bv-panel bv-guidance"><div class="bv-eyebrow">ULU Guidance</div><h3>What we recommend</h3><div class="bv-guide-section"><h4>Why this recommendation?</h4><ul><li>Your audience responds strongly to trust-building messages with clear benefits.</li><li>Credibility signals improve retention and action likelihood.</li></ul></div><div class="bv-guide-section"><h4>Key Signals</h4><ul><li>23% higher engagement with trust-first framing.</li><li>Strong response to founder-led content.</li><li>LinkedIn is outperforming other channels.</li></ul></div><div class="bv-guide-section"><h4>Recommended Next Step</h4><p style="font-size:9px;color:var(--bv-muted);line-height:1.5">Test a new strategy angle that highlights ROI and time saved.</p></div></section>
